    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About <i>Somnicore</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499300/extras/ecaae7cb17b6727bb450c91ffd6231e6.poster.avif?t=1751429933\" width=640 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499300/extras/ecaae7cb17b6727bb450c91ffd6231e6.webm?t=1751429933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499300/extras/ecaae7cb17b6727bb450c91ffd6231e6.mp4?t=1751429933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somnicore -\u00a0a short atmospheric game with a mix of puzzles and eerie moments.\u00a0Be prepared for a contemplative experience as you play. Many liminal spaces await you along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the action of the game takes place beyond our minds, in a dream.\u00a0This place is full of mysterious places and disturbing thoughts - maybe not in vain, you never know what hides in the impenetrable corners of sleep...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to immerse yourself in a surreal world that contains both fear and complete peace? <i>: )</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499300/extras/0a9164b2385c9f693192cc158076e441.poster.avif?t=1751429933\" width=638 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499300/extras/0a9164b2385c9f693192cc158076e441.webm?t=1751429933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499300/extras/0a9164b2385c9f693192cc158076e441.mp4?t=1751429933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric and nostalgic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unusual animations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vareity of locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles with <i>cats</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreams ?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developers:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499300/extras/c93d4ad0db91a289f1f99596498a29e7.avif?t=1751429933\" data-has-big width=800 height=352 /></span>The game is being developed by one person - <strong>Bacillus08</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can always find me on <i>Discord</i> or write to me by email <i><a href=\"mailto:bacillus08@yahoo.com\">bacillus08@yahoo.com</a></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The music was written by hand by one incognito <strong>Ivans</strong>.</p>",
